      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">Take our survey and help improve our youth flag football leagues!</h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Thank you for participating in our youth flag football leagues! This year we hit a record of over 350 youth participating in our league around Columbus!</p>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<h3 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 1em 0 17px;">Parent Survey</h3>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We strive to improve our programs and your feedback is important for our success. Please take our survey and share your experience with our program and the interactions with our community centers. </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe9C_lcbTwZwHPfY2EdHX4YapnIWB5wVx8N6-M6ymVtkghsbQ/viewform?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Parent Survey" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Take our parent survey here.</a></p>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<h3 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 1em 0 17px;">Participant Survey</h3>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We would also love to hear directly from your child about their experience. If you have more than one child, the survey can be used more than once.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdrvx1BXblSiel5U6nV2vdYBTFcFG39Tfq0WNHRGm0Z1iMUVQ/viewform?usp=sf_link&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Participant Survey" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">Take our participant survey here.</a></p>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<h3 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 1em 0 17px;">See You Next Season</h3>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We look forward to seeing you on the field next season and don't forget to check out all of our youth leagues at <a href="http://columbusrecparks.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" class="c-link" data-stringify-link="http://ColumbusRecParks.com" data-sk="tooltip_parent" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">ColumbusRecParks.com</a>.</p>
